---
const cases = [
  {
    name: '分类',
    expectation: '封闭类别中辨认对象',
    space: '类别极点、logit 与决策边界',
    density: '类别等价关系压缩无关差异'
  },
  {
    name: '人脸 / CLIP',
    expectation: '验证、检索与跨模态匹配',
    space: '具有任务语义的 embedding 距离',
    density: '成对、排序关系与概念覆盖'
  },
  {
    name: '语言模型',
    expectation: '预测并生成可变长度文本',
    space: 'token 序列与条件分布',
    density: '逐位置目标与广泛语料覆盖'
  },
  {
    name: 'Diffusion',
    expectation: '学习一对多的生成分布',
    space: '不同噪声层级上的局部修正',
    density: '逐位置、跨噪声层级的目标'
  },
  {
    name: 'BEV',
    expectation: '统一理解多相机三维环境',
    space: '自车或世界坐标中的鸟瞰表示',
    density: '跨相机、位置与时刻累积观测'
  },
  {
    name: 'AlphaFold2 / NeRF',
    expectation: '恢复三维结构或一致新视角',
    space: '关系几何或连续辐射场',
    density: '局部关系或多视图射线约束'
  }
]
---

<figure
  class='not-prose my-8 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-border/60 bg-card'
  aria-labelledby='case-landscape-title case-landscape-caption'
>
  <div class='p-3 sm:p-5'>
    <p id='case-landscape-title' class='m-0 text-base font-semibold text-foreground'>
      同一套分析：期待 → 问题空间 → 有效监督
    </p>
    <p class='mb-0 mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground'>
      案例的重点不是模型清单，而是每种表述保留了什么、又让数据怎样产生约束。
    </p>
  </div>

  <div
    class='hidden grid-cols-[0.7fr_1.25fr_1.45fr_1.35fr] border-y border-border/60 bg-muted/35 px-5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-muted-foreground md:grid'
  >
    <span>案例</span>
    <span>现实期待</span>
    <span>问题空间</span>
    <span>有效监督来源</span>
  </div>

  <ul class='m-0 list-none p-0' role='list'>
    {
      cases.map((item, index) => (
        <li
          class:list={[
            'grid gap-2 px-3 py-4 text-sm md:grid-cols-[0.7fr_1.25fr_1.45fr_1.35fr] md:px-5',
            index > 0 && 'border-t border-border/60'
          ]}
        >
          <span class='font-semibold text-foreground'>{item.name}</span>
          <span class='leading-6 text-muted-foreground'>
            <span class='font-semibold text-foreground md:hidden'>现实期待：</span>
            {item.expectation}
          </span>
          <span class='leading-6 text-foreground'>
            <span class='font-semibold md:hidden'>问题空间：</span>
            {item.space}
          </span>
          <span class='leading-6 text-muted-foreground'>
            <span class='font-semibold text-foreground md:hidden'>有效监督：</span>
            {item.density}
          </span>
        </li>
      ))
    }
  </ul>

  <figcaption
    id='case-landscape-caption'
    class='border-t border-border/60 px-3 py-3 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground sm:px-5'
  >
    图 2：问题空间的价值，在于把真实期待变成数据可以反复约束、模型可以共享规律的形式。
  </figcaption>
</figure>
